{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_30017_01_d",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:a6db721359b6e164fe55c35964083c5a7c0fe837e087af688adccf05afb1c7c7",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_d:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:08aa9fce46dd337334718e3ebe0c86faeb3a0275967783e9b914cb10047dd24d",
      "text": "一希先生，有想玩的曲子吗？\n我选哪首都可以哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_d:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:49ce7366db9db4fe4de88f43d8d1d92fa0fb101b833b7e8a2b3f6bd7e19bb8fc",
      "text": "…既然如此，选这首可以吗？\n我听过几次。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_d:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ead6939326aa33d823130465fa60cd74d4daae76158aff6ef7dd70edf51320d5",
      "text": "当然没问题！好～嘞，为了拿到比刚才\n更好的分数，加油咯～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_d:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b00f1bd063647c4b7fe824f1e02c54122e3fc03b69e35b16b2c87804aaf726e1",
      "text": "两个人就差一点点了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_d:cmd-000106:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ce34045c710919b903fbf116b8e1142102927946e7912b6f597d0fd2287f6590",
      "text": "…分数达不到规定值的话，就会失败啊。\n抱歉，凉。看来是我挑的曲子难度太高了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_d:cmd-000114:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9b79ee5f1e3a17a4ea979d644e16efba0a24883def50425102e07ada18fb7e95",
      "text": "没事的！\n确实很难，不过玩得很开心哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_d:cmd-000119:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a33d7833b20b0d0e80952b9270e7b4036984b0203bee3f98483a675d9c5b6a07",
      "text": "对了，我们再去试试别的游戏吧！\n那边那个看起来也挺好玩的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_d:cmd-000125:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a70f1bc89ee7d2051b1272ffc5d52dd8b51317e958711eabbef6fa5e4560660c",
      "text": "…呵。\n嗯，说得也是。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_d:cmd-000155:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:374ecba319291b8632c5cd2d640ced619911e7e5fd683497f4bb2b0607ea8244",
      "text": "哎呀～玩得可真过瘾啊。\n你们俩今天感觉如何？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_d:cmd-000181:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dd6336dd8510d3f6fe51576938f329223981e5f1a89f65a89640000595682040",
      "text": "我以前从没在游戏厅主要玩音游，\n感觉特别新鲜，超级开心的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_d:cmd-000192:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:38c7e1a03fe6893d012900c58dd4cbcb3fbc5a6e809ce44c0f8f36b519f2ab53",
      "text": "不过大致体验过一圈后我觉得，\n对初学者来说稍微有点难的游戏还蛮多的呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
